OL,3,GNEWSASecond rider killed in Manx Grand
OL,4,APrix qualifying
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second competitor has died during
OL,7,Fqualifying for the Manx Grand Prix on
OL,8,Fthe Isle of Man.
OL,10,FSam Naughton, from Castletown on the
OL,11,Fisland, was killed in a crash at
OL,12,FDoran's Bend, on the western section of
OL,13,Fthe course, on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,15,FThe 37-year-old was competing in the
OL,16,Fevent for the second time, having made
OL,17,Fhis debut on the 37.7 mile (61km)
OL,18,FMountain Course in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
